      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Video example: https://gfycat.com/reliablecalculatingadder\nIt started to happen like this with first update with avatars 3.0. It looks like idle animation given in IDLE in avatars 2.0 override controller does not control IK legs, or IK poles anymore. Though legs are not going outwards like this with default idle animations, only with custom ones, where IK poles aren't straight in front of knees. Also it does work like before while in any menu. It happens only on Dekstop and on VR, not on FBT of course.",
      "viewerReactions": null
