  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-08-29T11:44:35.514Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/idle-animation-cant-affect-leg-bones-anymore\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/using-the-custam-idle-animation-forces-the-legs-to-open-notably-in-femaleidle\nWhen non-FBT users have custom Idle animation set against Avator 2.0, the foot motions seem to be changed to those of Malle.\nFBT users also often deactivate FBT when they stay in the VRC for long periods of time.\nDepending on the avatar, the feet are changed to look like the avatar, but only the motion of the feet is disabled and they do a very strange pose.\nAlso, for some reason this effect is lifted when you are viewing the social menu.\nHonestly, I feel like the more avatars that try to close their legs in idle pose, the more they open their legs, which seems to be a terrible result.\nTranslated with www.DeepL.com/Translator (free version)",
